        <p>AGED PEOPLE'S CHRISTMAS TRK.A.T.—The ANNUAL SUBSCRIPTION DINNER for OLD MEN and TEA for AGED WOMEN will be held at the PARR BALL,WARRINGTON, on THURSDAY NEXT, JANUARY' 4t13.1906. Dinner at 12 o'clock at noon.and Tea at 6 o'clock in the evening. The nous' Public Entertainment will be held in the evening at 7.15 o'clock. Subscriptions will be thankfully received by any of the Ccmmittve. ALDERMAN J. SMETHURST, President",</p>
