        <p>G.-15.5( 0 guineas paid for a rock crystal biberon goUlet at Christie's. 2-S.—Great naval battle in the Straits of Korea (cam lit enced on previous d ay), Admiral Togo C ventually sinking or capturing :-.!3 of . the 20 ships of the Baltic luad- ron. Admirals Rojestvensky and Nebogatoff made prisoners. Japa- nese loss : Three torpedo boats and 537 officers and in o n. Russians lost 3000 prison- ers and about 7000 killed in ac- tion or drowned. 31,—Beal. at the Old Bailey, sentenced to death for the murder of Ellen Goodspeed at Camberwell.</p>
