        <p>Marquis or Bute and Miss A lignsta liellinghs The marriage of Lord into to Miss A g t a NI r y 111Jmica second 'daughter of Henry Belling- im,m. took pl.+ 00 Itt Castlehellingham in pieturesque and in- teresting eireum- Jtances. The village - was crowded with ii• the friends of both families. including many visitora from</p>
