        <p>Channel.</p>
        <p>•_;.i.—Toy railway accident in the isle of Man, a number of passengers being injured. :N.—Peace terms settled; Japan foregoes an indemnity ; Saghalien divided. 30.—King Edward. the German Emperor, and the French President send messages or congratu- lation to Mr. Roosevelt on the conclusion of peace.</p>
