        <head>SEPTEMBER.</head>
        <p>SEPTEMBER.</p>
        <p>I.—New Anglo-Japanese Agreement an- nounced. - M. 11l.lvain, K.C., M.P., was appointed Judge - Advocate - General. The appointment created a vacancy in the Parliamentary borough of Hampstead. Mr. Milvain was formerly M.P. "fdr Durham. Bail way disaster on the Great Eastein : Eleven killed, and over 40 injured. 2.—Ferryboat accident near Morecambe; air lives lost.</p>
